00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,340
Right now, in the mountains of Chile,

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:06,780
a brand new telescope just started searching for something nobody has ever seen.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,600
Astronomers are calling it Planet 9.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,720
Nobody has ever photographed it.

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,160
Nobody has directly detected it.

6
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,940
And yet, for almost 10 years,

7
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:21,060
some of the most respected astronomers in the world have been certain it's out there.

8
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:30,160
The man who first made the case is the same astronomer who got Pluto kicked out of

9
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,180
the And this year, for the first time,

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,920
the telescope built to finally settle the question is actually running.

